B.ad6=new A.l2("\ud83c\udfaf","Capture the 10s","The team that captures the most 10-value cards over 13 tricks wins the match. There are four 10s in the deck \u2014 one per suit.","Tiebreakers: most 10s, then most cards, then most aces",B.f)
